<view class="page">
  <view class="hero-card confirm-hero">
    <view class="hero-kicker">最后确认</view>
    <view class="hero-title">确认材料后再投</view>
    <view class="hero-subtitle">先核对岗位、简历和求职信。系统不会替你全自动投递。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card target-card">
    <view class="section-title compact">要投递的岗位</view>
    <view class="job-name">{{job.title}}</view>
    <view class="muted">{{job.school_name}} · {{job.district}} · {{job.subject}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card verify-card">
    <view class="section-title compact">投递前核验</view>
    <view class="verify-row">
      <view class="pill {{sourceStatusClass}}">{{sourceStatusText}}</view>
      <view class="verify-chip">{{emailRiskText}}</view>
      <view class="verify-chip">{{deadlineRiskText}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{isExpired}}" class="expired-notice">
    <view class="expired-title">已过截止日期</view>
    <view>这个岗位只能作为历史参考。系统不会允许确认投递，除非你在官方公告里确认有延期或补报名。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title compact">选择这次使用的材料</view>
    <picker range="{{resumes}}" bindchange="onResumeChange">
      <view class="select-row"><text>简历</text><text>{{selectedResume}}</text><text class="arrow">›</text></view>
    </picker>
    <picker range="{{templates}}" bindchange="onTemplateChange">
      <view class="select-row"><text>模板</text><text>{{selectedTemplate}}</text><text class="arrow">›</text></view>
    </picker>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title compact">求职信预览，可修改</view>
    <textarea value="{{coverLetter}}" maxlength="-1" auto-height bindinput="onLetterInput" />
  </view>

  <view class="card checklist-card">
    <view class="section-title compact">三项确认</view>
    <view class="check-row {{checks.source ? 'done' : ''}}" data-key="source" bindtap="toggleCheck">
      <view class="check-box">{{checks.source ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
      <view>
        <view class="check-title-text">我已核对公告来源和截止时间</view>
        <view class="check-desc">来源待确认时，请先回公告原文确认。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="check-row {{checks.materials ? 'done' : ''}}" data-key="materials" bindtap="toggleCheck">
      <view class="check-box">{{checks.materials ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
      <view>
        <view class="check-title-text">我已核对证书、附件和报名表</view>
        <view class="check-desc">教师资格证、普通话、学历材料都要能对应。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="check-row {{checks.resume ? 'done' : ''}}" data-key="resume" bindtap="toggleCheck">
      <view class="check-box">{{checks.resume ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
      <view>
        <view class="check-title-text">我已确认简历内容真实</view>
        <view class="check-desc">只允许突出真实经历，不能补写不存在的证书或年限。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    <view class="notice-title">不会自动投递</view>
    <view>为了避免误投，每一次投递都必须由你确认。正式上线后也不会跳过这一步。</view>
  </view>

  <button class="primary-btn {{canApply && !isExpired ? '' : 'disabled'}}" bindtap="confirmApply">{{applyButtonText}}</button>
</view>
